(Toolique is an impressively extensive client-side web application comprising over 338 specialized tools across civil engineering,) Tj
T* (architecture, financial calculators, developer utilities, compliance audits, and math solvers. Built on cutting-edge foundational) Tj
T* (libraries \(React 19, Vite 8, TypeScript 6, Tailwind CSS v4\), the platform delivers outstanding zero-server privacy, high speed,) Tj
T* (and rich client-side computational capabilities.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (However, rapid feature expansion has created critical technical debt: 346,280 lines of code distributed with high repetition) Tj
T* (across independent tool files. Dozens of components independently re-implement clipboard copying, raw PDF generation, file) Tj
T* (downloading, localStorage persistence, unit switching, and civil engineering math. Moreover, several monolithic tools exceed) Tj
T* (2,000–4,800 lines in single files, while the entire application operates with zero React Error Boundaries and zero automated) Tj
T* (unit tests.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (By executing the systematic modularization and code deduplication roadmap outlined in this report, Toolique can eliminate over) Tj
T* (25,000 redundant lines of code, shrink the bundle size by 30–45%, protect against runtime white-screen crashes, and) Tj
T* (dramatically accelerate developer velocity.) Tj
